StatisticsOfTheDailyRaport ;i;hours;uniqhours;sumuniq;mostsellhour
⍝ Generates daily sales statistics report.
hours← (2↑¨OrderTime)
uniqhours← ∪hours
sumuniq ← {(+/uniqhours⍳hours)=⍵}¨⍳⍴uniqhours
mostsellhour ← uniqhours[sumuniq⍳⌈/sumuniq]


⎕←'Statistics of the Daily Raport'
⎕←'=============================='
⎕←'ESPRESSO HOUSE SWEDEN'
⎕←orgnmr
⎕←''
⎕←''

⎕←'Total Revenue: '
⎕← +/(Price[∊Orders])
⎕←''
⎕←'-------------------'
⎕←'Sales by the product:'


:For i :In ⍳⍴ItemName
⎕←'-----------'
⎕←'Item Name: ' , ItemName[i]
⎕←'Total sold products: ' , +/∊Orders=i
⎕←'Total Revenue by the product: ' , (+/∊Orders=i)×Price[i]
⎕←'-----------'
:EndFor

⎕←'Most selling product of the day:'
⎕←'Item Name: ' , ItemName[counts⍳⌈/counts]
⎕←'Total Sales: ' , ⌈/counts
⎕←''
⎕←'--------------------------------'
⎕←''
⎕←'Least selling product of the day: '
⎕←'Item Name: ' , ItemName[counts⍳⌊/counts]
⎕←'Total Sales: ' , ⌊/counts
⎕←''
⎕←'--------------------------------'
⎕←''
⎕←'Total products sold: ' , ≢(∊Orders)
⎕←'Average Price of product sold: ' , (+/(Price[∊Orders]))÷(≢(∊Orders))
⎕←'Total Guests: ' , Guests
⎕←''
⎕←''
⎕←'------------------------'
⎕←'Most selling hour time of the day: '
⎕←'From: ',⍕mostsellhour,':00 , Untill: ', ⍕mostsellhour,':59.'
⎕←'Total sold products during that time: ' , +/(uniqhours⍳hours)=(sumuniq⍳⌈/sumuniq)
⎕←'-------------------------'
⎕←''
⎕←''
⎕←'Total guests with discount: ' , +/Discount∊⊂'Yes'
⎕←'Total guests without discount: ' , +/Discount∊⊂'No'
⎕←'--------------------------------'
⎕←''
⎕←''
⎕←'Total payments with card: ', +/Payment∊⊂'Card'
⎕←'Total payments with swish: ', +/Payment∊⊂'Swish'
⎕←''
⎕←''
⎕←'------------------------------'
⎕←'==================================='
⎕←'End of the statistics of the daily raport'
⎕←'ESPRESSO HOUSE SWEDEN'
